data EvTxt chars "     JESUS OF NAZARETH        ALEXANDRIAN STEAM ENGINE        VESUVIUS ERUPTS          PTOLEMY'S SOLAR SYSTEM      VISIGOTHS OVERRUN ROME     ALEXANDRIA LIBRARY BURNS        DARK AGES BEGIN            BIRTH OF MUHAMMAD             PUEBLO INDIANS            AGE OF CHARLEMAGNE        LEIF ERICSSON'S VOYAGE      WILLIAM THE CONQUEROR          BAYEUX TAPESTRY         CRUSADERS SACK BYZANTIUM          MAGNA CARTA            BLACK PLAGUE OF EUROPE    GUTENBERG'S PRINTING PRESS      RENAISSANCE BEGINS        SISTINE CHAPEL CEILING       CORTES AND MONTEZUMA      DRAKE CIRCLES THE GLOBE         MAYFLOWER SAILS              NEWTON'S LAWS              SALEM WITCH HUNT          BEN FRANKLIN'S KITE         AMERICAN REVOLUTION              COTTON GIN               MONROE DOCTRINE                CIVIL WAR                 TITANIC SINKS                WORLD WAR I               GREAT DEPRESSION          HINDENBURG DISASTER             WORLD WAR II                 HIROSHIMA              TRANSISTOR PATENTED      BANNISTER'S 4 MINUTE MILE      CUBAN MISSILE CRISIS             MOON WALK                   WATERGATE              MAO TSE-TUNG'S DEATH           TEST TUBE BABY          COMMODORE 64 RELEASED       AHOY! MAGAZINE CREATED       US/USSR ARMS TREATY     "

